    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Left Stick - Move (on the ground, while not aiming)

    Left Stick (in
    the air) - Nudge distance / drift sideways

    Left Trigger - Aim (hold; the
    cube stays put)

    Left Stick (while aiming) - Adjust aim direction

    Right
    Trigger - Launch

    South - Show/hide the landing preview

    Right Stick
    - Camera

    Start / Options / Esc - Pause


    (Hold-Release and Analog launch
    schemes are still in the project, just disabled)'
